BBUUGGSS
     ccaamm__ooppeenn__ddeevviiccee() does not check to see if the _p_a_t_h passed in is a sym‐
     link to something.  It also does not check to see if the _p_a_t_h passed in
     is an actual pass(4) device.  The former would be rather easy to imple‐
     ment, but the latter would require a definitive way to identify a device
     node as a pass(4) device.

     Some of the functions are possibly misnamed or poorly named.

